{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lonelight is a short Action-RPG set in a post-apocalyptic Earth-3.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a quick look at what this experience has to offer: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/gif5.gif?t=1749660673\" /><strong>LIGHT POINTS: Use them wisely!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lonelight features a unique HP system that differs a bit from most other games in the genre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light Points serve as your HP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a Light Level meter that's directly connected to how many Light Points you currently have.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also use your Light Points to ignore your cooldown timers, giving you more freedom during combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/gif1.gif?t=1749660673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COMBAT: DASH, SMASH, and SLASH your way through a unique cast of enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your 3 main abilities to face off against:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Security robots following orders.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Corrupted beings still roaming the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thematic boss fights each with their own unique fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And... maybe even something else entirely?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749660673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORATION: Explore the ruins of a forgotten world...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features multiple different areas for you to dive into, each area features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich, immersive atmosphere unique to that region.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of different musical tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles/obstacles blocking the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distinct characters and story arcs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many mysteries to solve...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/gif4.gif?t=1749660673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LORE: Uncover the secrets left behind by your creator...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Guidelines, here you can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A charming yet unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A very distinct soundtrack from the rest of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surreal settings exploring wild themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of questions left to answer...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749660673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have fun and enjoy your time in this atmospheric world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here's some more info on the game in case you're interested:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Around 4 hours of content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extremely unfunny NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pretty cool pixel graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of soda cans (and a weird burger).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden pet rock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A neat handcrafted experience made by a single dev :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Don't let the light fade away.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741470?t=1749660673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741470?t=1749660673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/979806a20f4ad680cd30cbc93627449c90b88f14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749660673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/979806a20f4ad680cd30cbc93627449c90b88f14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749660673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lonelight is a short Action-RPG set in a post-apocalyptic Earth-3.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a quick look at what this experience has to offer: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/gif5.gif?t=1749660673\" /><strong>LIGHT POINTS: Use them wisely!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lonelight features a unique HP system that differs a bit from most other games in the genre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light Points serve as your HP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a Light Level meter that's direc