=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/gif4.gif?t=1749660673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LORE: Uncover the secrets left behind by your creator...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Guidelines, here you can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A charming yet unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A very distinct soundtrack from the rest of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surreal settings exploring wild themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of questions left to answer...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749660673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have fun and enjoy your time in this atmospheric world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here's some more info on the game in case you're interested:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Around 4 hours of content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extremely unfunny NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pretty cool pixel graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of soda cans (and a weird burger).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden pet rock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A neat handcrafted experience made by a single dev :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Don't let the light fade away.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["FYLLAS"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/eff1ccc4d8521d506e0b07c07a2f76e0852973a3/header.jpg?t=1749660673","is_free":